<title>UK: LPC - GUS gets $800 mln loan for Experian buy.</title>
<headline>LPC - GUS gets $800 mln loan for Experian buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, November 14 (LPC) - BZW and Chase Investment Bank have been mandated to arrange an $800 million term loan for Great Universal Stores Plc (GUS) which backs the company's $1.7 billion acquisition of U.S. company Experian, the banks said.</p>
<p>The credit is fully underwritten by Barclays Bank and Chase Manhattan Bank and is expected to launch into general syndication shortly.</p>
<p>Experian is a supplier of credit, marketing and real estate information services.</p>
<p>LPC Newsroom 44-171-542-4048</p>
</text>
